5,0,1,talk,Sakura,,Hi everyone! This is going to be so much fun! I wonder who the scary werewolf is? Hehe!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Minako,,Let's stay focused. We need to find the werewolf efficiently. Does anyone have any initial thoughts?,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Victoria,,I agree with Minako. Let's observe each other's reactions carefully.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Takumi,,"I'm not scared of any werewolf! I'll find them and protect everyone, just watch me!","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Misaki,,Let's just proceed calmly.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Sakura,,@Takumi is so brave! Maybe too brave? Or maybe he's hiding something? Just kidding!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Minako,,"Sakura, try to avoid making baseless accusations. It only creates confusion.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Victoria,,"It is still too early for accusations, but the way people present themselves is telling.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"I'm not hiding anything! I'm just ready to fight! @Sakura, stop teasing me!","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
