19,0,3,talk,Misaki,,Victoria is right. A premature reveal is risky.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Sakura,,I'll just follow along and see what happens! This is like a real mystery novel!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Minako,,"Understood. For now, let's just observe. I'll be watching everyone closely.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
